  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "故鄉ê香味"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">郭文卿</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">西港香 隔三秋 人講台灣第一香（hiunn）</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">謝豬羊 拴燒酒 請阮至親好朋友</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">陣頭藝閣拚千秋 王爺媽祖巡四周</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">火燒王船直直求 普渡眾生消憂愁</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉刈香味 文化傳承永相隨</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉刈香味 代代相傳萬萬年</span><br />\n<br />\n<a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">麻油香 配油蔥 氣味勝過香水香（phang）</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">生理人 呵咾讚 相招相約來西港</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">燒燒一碗補喙空 活力源泉拚歸工</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">消腫止癢防蚊蟲 好食好用一世人</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉油香味 甘甘甜甜烏色緻</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉油香味 鼻了嘴涎插插滴</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">夜來香 吐芬芳 花開花謝阮故鄉（hiong）</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">展笑容 無勉強 恬恬無聲無話講</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">高雅純白免畫妝 自然美麗無膨風</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">日落黃昏味漸濃 含苞花蕊等情郎</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉暗香味 伴阮美夢到三更</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: Times, Times New Roman, serif;\">故鄉暗香味 引阮珠淚思念伊</span>"
  },
